{"seq":32,"slug":"build-tooling-bundlers","title":"前端构建工具链与打包","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 前端构建工具链与打包\n\n浏览器只认识它当下能解析的那几种资源：HTML、CSS、能直接运行的 JavaScript，外加图片字体之类的静态文件。可是我们写代码时用的，是几百个互相 `import` 的模块、是 TypeScript 与 JSX、是带嵌套与变量的 CSS 预处理语言。这中间的鸿沟，正是「构建工具链」存在的全部理由——它把人类舒服的写法，翻译成机器与网络喜欢的形态。\n\n这个 hub 沿着一条因果链展开，四个章节层层递进，而不是四堆并列的工具说明书。\n\n第一条主线是「基础原理」。在认识任何具体打包器之前，得先弄清三件事：JavaScript 的模块格式是怎么从 CommonJS、AMD 一路走到 ES Module 的，一次完整的构建到底经历了哪些阶段，以及代码转换为什么绕不开抽象语法树（AST）。这三篇是后面所有内容的词汇表——「依赖图」「转译」「副作用」这些词，都在这里定义清楚。\n\n第二条主线是「打包器」。有了原理，再看真正干活的工具就不再是黑盒。我们深入 Webpack 这个定义了一个时代的集大成者，对比 Rollup 与 esbuild 这一对「精于产物」与「快到极致」的组合，最后落到 Vite——它用「开发期不打包、生产期才打包」的双模式架构，重写了我们对开发体验的预期，而 2026 年的 Rolldown 又让它的两个模式重归统一。\n\n第三条主线是「优化」。打包器能跑起来只是及格线，真正决定线上体验的是产物质量：代码分割让用户只下载当前页面需要的部分，Tree Shaking 把没用到的代码连根拔起，内容哈希让浏览器缓存既长效又精准。这三篇都建立在第二条主线的工具能力之上。\n\n第四条主线是「工程化」。当项目从一个仓库长成几十个包的 Monorepo、当构建从本地一次跑变成 CI 里每天跑几百次，问题就从「怎么打包」变成「怎么不重复打包」。这一章讲任务编排、远程缓存与增量构建，以及把开发体验拉满的 HMR——它其实是开发服务器对前三条主线的一次综合应用。\n\n读这个 hub 的顺序就是它的章节顺序。如果你已经熟悉某条主线，每篇文档之间都有交叉链接，可以顺着「依赖图」「副作用」「内容哈希」这些概念在不同篇章间跳转，把它们织成一张网，而不是孤立地背诵。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"module-systems","title":"模块系统演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/foundations/module-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"build-pipeline-overview","title":"构建流程总览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/foundations/build-pipeline-overview"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ast-transforms","title":"AST 与代码转换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/foundations/ast-transforms"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"bundlers","title":"打包器","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/bundlers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"webpack-deep","title":"Webpack 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/bundlers/webpack-deep"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rollup-esbuild","title":"Rollup 与 esbuild","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/bundlers/rollup-esbuild"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vite-architecture","title":"Vite 架构与按需编译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/bundlers/vite-architecture"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"optimization","title":"优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"code-splitting","title":"代码分割与懒加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/optimization/code-splitting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tree-shaking","title":"Tree Shaking 与副作用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/optimization/tree-shaking"},{"seq":3,"slug":"caching-hashing","title":"缓存与内容哈希","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/optimization/caching-hashing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monorepo-build","title":"Monorepo 构建与任务编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/engineering/monorepo-build"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ci-build-perf","title":"构建性能与 CI 缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/engineering/ci-build-perf"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dev-server-hmr","title":"开发服务器与 HMR","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/engineering/dev-server-hmr"}]}]}